    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" width=648 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.webm?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.mp4?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.gif?t=1753287680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.apng?t=1753287680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" width=648 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.webm?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.mp4?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" width=648 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.webm?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.mp4?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.gif?t=1753287680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.apng?t=1753287680\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.poster.avif?t=1753287680\" width=648 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.webm?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.mp4?t=1753287680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Decorate your own cozy workspace! \u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f combines relaxing Lo-Fi music and room decoration into one productivity game. Cute avatars and pets will keep you company, while desktop Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists boost your efficiency.",
